About MIT-WPU & Student Attributes
MIT-WPU prides itself on offering a holistic education catering to an individual’s educational, physical as well as spiritual well-be-
ing. Our syllabus reflects our pursuit to balance the
requirements of the industry along with advancement in scholarly learning. The teaching methods employed are a perfect blend of
practical knowledge, industry visits, guest lectures, student exchange Programmes and rural immersion visits. We have numerous
Programmes, events, clubs and activities undertaken throughout the year for the refinement of our student’s
extracurricular abilities and social skills.
Vision
‘Powering The Future’
With Effective, Sustainable, Inclusive, and Progressive Transformation that impacts society with Education, Innovation, and Culture.
Mission
• Me-Culture in our shared commitment to lead by example
• We-Culture of empathy and compassion, reflected in our focus on improving the current state of affairs
• Co-Culture in our interdisciplinary and collaborative approach
