an official email or application letter from the New University stating the request for a migration certificate.
7. A Transfer Certificate or Migration Certificate shall be issued only if the applicant student has no dues.
8. The fees to MIT World Peace University is annual fees and not semester fees. For the convenience of the students and parents, it is
charged in pre-specified installments.
9. Students have to ensure that the fees is paid for the whole academic year.
