penal law or any law in force at that time.
6. We hereby declare that I have not been expelled or debarred from admission in any institution in the country on
account of being found guilty of, abetting or being part of a conspiracy to promote ragging; and further affirm
that, in case the declaration is found to be untrue, I am aware that my / my ward’s admission is liable to be cancelled.
